# Web port

- Vanilla HTML/JS/CSS. No framework. Playable artifact is a **standalone HTML** from `build.py` (see `plans/architecture.md` / `plans/decisions.md`).
- Edit split `caves.css` + `js/*`; do not rely on `fetch` of `.LVL` in the play build — use `LVL_DATA`.
- Canvas should match TI-85 feel: 1-bit / small framebuffer, pixel-scaled, no glossy UI unless planned.
- Keyboard only; map from `plans/controls.md`.
- Keep engine, renderer, input, and level loader separable.
